From: Sumanth Gavini <sumanth.gavini@windriver.com>
Date: Fri, 29 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Do not install the pkgconfig dependency generator

RPM 6 dropped the external __find_requires/__find_provides generator and
only runs the internal fileattr generators. rpm's pkgconfig.attr then
generates, for every package shipping a .pc file:

  Provides: pkgconfig(foo)
  Requires: pkgconfig(foo)
  Requires: /usr/bin/pkg-config

OpenEmbedded manages build and runtime dependencies explicitly via
DEPENDS/RDEPENDS and does not want these. They make -dev packages
uninstallable during image do_rootfs and SDK do_populate_sdk, and they
are non-reproducible because they are only emitted when pkg-config
happens to be present in the build sysroot.

Suppressing the generator from the rpmbuild command line
(__pkgconfig_requires / __pkgconfig_provides / __pkgconfig_path /
__requires_exclude set to %{nil}) is not reliable: rpm reloads the
fileattr macros during dependency generation and clobbers the --define.
Remove the generator from the install so it is never available.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [OE policy: dependencies are managed by
the build system, not generated by rpmbuild]

Signed-off-by: Sumanth Gavini <sumanth.gavini@windriver.com>
---
 fileattrs/CMakeLists.txt | 2 +-
 scripts/CMakeLists.txt   | 1 -
 2 files changed, 1 insertion(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/fileattrs/CMakeLists.txt b/fileattrs/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/fileattrs/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/fileattrs/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 install(FILES
 	debuginfo.attr desktop.attr elf.attr font.attr metainfo.attr
-	pkgconfig.attr ocaml.attr
+	ocaml.attr
 	rpm_macro.attr rpm_lua.attr script.attr sysusers.attr usergroup.attr
 	DESTINATION ${RPM_CONFIGDIR}/fileattrs
 )
diff --git a/scripts/CMakeLists.txt b/scripts/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/scripts/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/scripts/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -5,7 +5,6 @@ install(PROGRAMS
 	check-files check-prereqs
 	check-buildroot check-rpaths check-rpaths-worker
 	find-lang.sh find-requires find-provides
-	pkgconfigdeps.sh
 	ocamldeps.sh
 	fontconfig.prov script.req
 	rpm_macros_provides.sh
